% Test: guard provides the sole reader occurrence for SRSW validation
% Per spec: guard reader occurrences count toward SRSW validation.
% A reader in a guard satisfies the reader requirement for its paired writer.

% known/1 guard: X is writer in head, X? is reader in guard
guard_known(X) :- known(X?) | true.

% ground/1 guard 
guard_ground(X) :- ground(X?) | true.

% integer/1 guard
guard_int(X) :- integer(X?) | true.

% Arithmetic comparison guard: both X? and Y? are readers
guard_compare(X, Y) :- X? < Y? | true.

% Negated guard
guard_neg_known(X) :- ~known(X?) | true.
